  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nIs there a particular reason the `appearance: base` select min sizes are written as:\n```css\n  min-block-size: calc-size(auto, max(size, 24px, 1lh));\n  min-inline-size: calc-size(auto, max(size, 24px));\n```\nInstead of:\n```css\n  min-block-size: max(24px, 1lh);\n  min-inline-size: 24px;\n```\n?",
